Basic CGE Model 1.0
C o m p i l a t i o n


   2   
   3  *----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4  *This is a simple single-region, single-sector, two-factor, close-economy CGE model.
   5  *The firm maximizes its profit subjected to constant return-to-scale CES technology.
   6  *The households treat all of its income as disposable (no savings),
   7  *and maximize its utility (following a log function) subjected to the budget constraint.
   8  *There are no governments, investments, nor the exports/imports.
   9  *In total, there are three markets: the goods market & two factor markets.
  10  *----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  11   


